    "start": "node server.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "axios": "^1.6.0",
    "body-parser": "^1.20.2",
    "cors": "^2.8.5",
    "dotenv": "^16.3.1",
    "express": "^4.18.2"
  }
}
```

---

### 4. Frontend Interface (`public/index.html`)
Designed to blend in as a standard utility tool (e.g., a unit converter or notepad) to maintain discretion.

```html
